- ### The syntax tree
+ ### El árbol sintáctico

- The `children` of a document are `Layout` nodes, and each has its inline content as `Prose`.
- A document can therefore be inspected, or transformed, by matching on the tree:
+ Los `children` de un documento son nodos `Layout`, y cada uno tiene su contenido en línea como
+ `Prose`. Por tanto, un documento se puede inspeccionar, o transformar, con una coincidencia de
+ patrones sobre el árbol:

= A document can therefore be inspected, or transformed, by matching on the tree:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val heading = document.children.head match
+ val heading = document.children.head match

-   case Layout.Heading(_, level, Prose.Textual(text)) => (level, text)
+   case Layout.Heading(_, level, Prose.Textual(text)) => (level, text)

-   case _                                             => (0, t"")
+   case _                                             => (0, t"")

=   case _                                             => (0, t"")
- ```
+ ```

=   case _                                             => (0, t"")
= ```
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

=   case _                                             => (0, t"")
= ```
